1
00:02:31,068 --> 00:02:36,068
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:36,068 --> 00:02:41,068
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:41,068 --> 00:02:45,068
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:45,068 --> 00:02:50,068
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:50,068 --> 00:02:53,068
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:53,068 --> 00:02:56,068
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,068 --> 00:02:59,068
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,068 --> 00:03:02,068
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:03,068 --> 00:03:05,068
Now this is exciting!

10
00:03:06,068 --> 00:03:09,068
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:09,068 --> 00:03:12,068
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:12,068 --> 00:03:17,068
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:20,068 --> 00:03:22,068
Separated from the rest of his crew,

14
00:03:22,068 --> 00:03:26,068
Luffy has finally arrived at Marineford to rescue his brother Ace.

15
00:03:26,068 --> 00:03:29,068
However, the two could not escape Admiral Aka Inu,

16
00:03:29,068 --> 00:03:31,068
and Ace died protecting Luffy.

17
00:03:31,068 --> 00:03:34,068
Then suddenly, Blackbeard appeared, killing Whitebeard,

18
00:03:34,068 --> 00:03:37,068
and accomplishing something truly unthinkable.

19
00:03:38,068 --> 00:03:40,068
Just watch!

20
00:03:42,068 --> 00:03:44,068
No, it can't be!

21
00:03:44,068 --> 00:04:01,068
The Insatiable Aka Inu, Lava Fist's Pummel Luffy!

22
00:04:01,068 --> 00:04:14,068
The H-C-U's coming down!

23
00:04:14,068 --> 00:04:15,068
Run, Moran!

24
00:04:20,068 --> 00:04:22,068
Abandon your bones!

25
00:04:22,068 --> 00:04:24,068
