29
00:04:33,068 --> 00:04:34,068
The pirates.

30
00:04:34,068 --> 00:04:36,068
They took everything we had.

31
00:04:37,068 --> 00:04:40,068
Our citadel where we've watched over these waters for centuries.

32
00:04:41,068 --> 00:04:42,068
