33
00:04:43,068 --> 00:04:45,068
The symbol of the Navy's strength.

34
00:04:45,068 --> 00:04:47,068
This is a nightmare!

35
00:04:48,068 --> 00:04:49,068
The...

36
00:04:49,068 --> 00:04:52,068
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

37
