Damn!

38
00:04:55,068 --> 00:04:57,068
He planned this from the very start, didn't he?

39
00:04:57,068 --> 00:05:00,068
He betrayed Whitebeard, captured Ace, and became a warlord!

40
00:05:00,068 --> 00:05:02,068
