96
00:08:59,068 --> 00:09:02,068
We'll show every criminal what happens when you defy the law!

97
00:09:03,068 --> 00:09:05,068
We'll let the whole world know!

98
00:09:06,068 --> 00:09:07,068
That justice will prevail!

99
00:09:08,068 --> 00:09:09,068
