198
00:14:12,688 --> 00:14:19,588
Still have some fight left in you? That's a pity.

199
00:14:33,288 --> 00:14:39,288
Forgive me, Luffy. It seems that I couldn't uphold my vow.

200
00:14:39,288 --> 00:14:43,448
You might have saved yourself instead of condemning the both of you.

201
00:14:52,708 --> 00:14:56,008
If you keep making me miss, it won't be good for anyone.

202
00:14:56,908 --> 00:14:59,748
A blow to the heart would be quick and painless.

203
00:15:00,468 --> 00:15:02,008
Better than this.

204
00:15:02,008 --> 00:15:13,588
The boy's got a hole in his chest. You sure you still want to protect him?

205
00:15:13,588 --> 00:15:21,388
You know he's going to die either way.

206
00:15:21,388 --> 00:15:23,388
Aaaaaah!

207
00:15:40,588 --> 00:15:44,088
Jinbei. I know I might not make it out of this alive.

208
00:15:44,088 --> 00:15:49,988
Jinbei. I'm sorry, but if I die, would you look after my brother for me?

209
00:15:50,988 --> 00:15:54,268
Although your death was a tragedy, it did not sway my feelings.

210
00:15:54,568 --> 00:15:56,428
Yet I found the answer to your request.

211
00:15:57,168 --> 00:15:59,188
You aren't the only tenacious one here.

212
00:15:59,628 --> 00:16:02,508
I've decided to protect this boy no matter the cause.

213
00:16:02,508 --> 00:16:21,588
I refuse to let him perish.

214
00:16:21,588 --> 00:16:21,608
I refuse to let him perish.

215
00:16:21,608 --> 00:16:34,468
Strike me as many times as you like.

216
00:16:35,048 --> 00:16:37,528
I will shield him as long as I live.

217
00:16:43,528 --> 00:16:45,148
What a load of crap.

218
00:16:51,608 --> 00:16:57,828
He protected us.

219
00:16:58,028 --> 00:16:58,788
Nabal!

220
00:16:59,328 --> 00:16:59,768
Yeah!

221
00:17:06,108 --> 00:17:10,048
They won't be up there long, so catch them when they fall and put them on a ship.

222
00:17:10,148 --> 00:17:10,568
Uh-huh.

223
00:17:10,908 --> 00:17:12,708
Why the sudden change of heart?

224
00:17:13,108 --> 00:17:15,948
I say, if you're going to protect someone, then do it right.

225
00:17:16,288 --> 00:17:20,288
I don't like either of you, but if you screw this up, then you'll let the Navy win.

226
00:17:21,608 --> 00:17:26,568
Sorry, I blew it, guys.

227
00:17:26,748 --> 00:17:30,568
You had so much faith in me, but I was nothing more than a coward all along.

228
00:17:30,688 --> 00:17:33,228
I'll just float away somewhere and find a hole to crawl in,

229
00:17:33,268 --> 00:17:35,748
because the only thing I'm the king of is to survive it.

230
00:17:35,828 --> 00:17:37,408
Oh crap, they're getting away!

231
00:17:39,028 --> 00:17:39,548
Fuck!

232
00:17:44,828 --> 00:17:46,268
They're stuck in the air?

233
00:17:47,568 --> 00:17:49,188
Wait, what's happening here?

234
00:17:49,308 --> 00:17:50,988
Nice catch, Captain Buggy!

235
00:17:50,988 --> 00:17:53,288
You saved Straw Hat and Jinbe!

236
00:17:54,708 --> 00:17:57,028
I never should have doubted you.

237
00:17:57,948 --> 00:17:59,008
He wasn't running.

238
00:17:59,268 --> 00:18:01,148
He was just looking out for Straw Hat,

239
00:18:01,288 --> 00:18:05,908
because all the glory in the world means nothing compared to the life of an old friend.

240
00:18:07,128 --> 00:18:08,248
How beautiful!

241
00:18:09,248 --> 00:18:12,028
His heart's as pure as a baby lamb!

242
00:18:12,408 --> 00:18:15,328
I can't hear what they're saying, but I bet it's stupid.

243
00:18:15,328 --> 00:18:19,668
Huh? Jinbe? And Straw Hat? What the hell?

244
00:18:20,748 --> 00:18:24,328
What are you idiots doing all the way up here, and why are you both covered in blood?

245
00:18:24,428 --> 00:18:26,048
This is weird, even for you guys.

246
00:18:26,288 --> 00:18:28,308
Also, is it just me, or is it hot?

247
00:18:28,308 --> 00:18:30,228
I don't know what's going on right now.

248
00:18:30,228 --> 00:18:34,028
I'm afraid I allowed Luffy to be harmed.

249
00:18:34,028 --> 00:18:37,908
Thank you, my red-nosed friend.

250
00:18:37,908 --> 00:18:39,828
You saved our lives.

251
00:18:39,988 --> 00:18:42,828
We're not friends. I don't even know what's going on right now.

252
00:18:42,868 --> 00:18:45,928
I'm afraid I allowed Luffy to be harmed.

253
00:18:46,148 --> 00:18:49,568
We must find a doctor. He was burned quite badly.

254
00:18:50,028 --> 00:18:51,248
I don't care!

255
00:18:51,468 --> 00:18:54,148
And good luck finding a doctor in the middle of this mess.

256
00:18:54,148 --> 00:18:56,488
I had to trump the both of you right now.

257
00:18:56,948 --> 00:18:59,028
Wait, were you making fun of my nose?

258
00:18:59,268 --> 00:19:02,588
How many people do I have to go through to finish that breath?

259
00:19:02,668 --> 00:19:04,028
