260
00:19:04,028 --> 00:19:25,228
You're fools, each and every one of you.

261
00:19:25,668 --> 00:19:29,588
Is one boy so damned important that you're willing to throw your lives away?

262
00:19:29,588 --> 00:19:36,828
You may mock us if you please, but there is a strength in Straw Hat's tenacity that may prove invaluable to this world.

263
00:19:37,348 --> 00:19:41,248
Pop spent his life on him. He has to carry on Ace's legacy.

264
00:19:41,868 --> 00:19:45,868
This is the dawn of a new era, and we have a duty to see him through it.

265
00:19:45,988 --> 00:19:51,888
Noble sentiment from a bunch of criminals, but in the end, it's just empty talk.

266
00:19:59,588 --> 00:20:03,948
I won't hesitate to strike you down.

267
00:20:04,348 --> 00:20:05,268
Same here.

268
00:20:05,788 --> 00:20:10,048
Your insistence on killing Straw Hat just proves to us how much you fear him.

269
00:20:10,368 --> 00:20:14,668
And if a tough guy like you is scared of a boy like him, that means he's worth protecting.

